    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE COMMUNITY ON THE DESTROYER DOGGO DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/8733e1f396ae115edb70c73de1de0d91.avif?t=1746848657\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the warm and welcoming world of Bao Bao's Cozy Laundromat, where our lovable panda, Bao Bao, is eager to share her dream with you. Starting with just 500\ud83d\udcb0, you'll help Bao Bao transform a humble beginning into a bustling haven of cleanliness and charm. Picture rows of vibrant, colorful washing machines humming gently, alongside dryers that turn laundry day into a soothing ritual. But it\u2019s not just about washing clothes\u2014it's about creating a space that feels like home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/7804e347ad4a9692801eb1c39acab7dd.poster.avif?t=1746848657\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/7804e347ad4a9692801eb1c39acab7dd.webm?t=1746848657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/7804e347ad4a9692801eb1c39acab7dd.mp4?t=1746848657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you and Bao Bao work together, you'll have the chance to add all sorts of delightful touches: cozy furniture where customers can relax with a good book, snack-filled vending machines that bring joy to those waiting, and lush, leafy plants that breathe life into every corner. And because no great venture is ever truly solo, you'll soon be able to welcome other panda friends to join the fun, each bringing their own special touch to the laundromat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's even more relaxing is that Bao Bao's Cozy Laundromat is an idle game, meaning you can let it run peacefully in the background without needing too much interaction. Your laundromat will keep thriving, even when you're off doing other things, allowing you to return to a bustling, cozy environment whenever you're ready. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/5114a5699969f7fa1001d54795f76813.poster.avif?t=1746848657\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/5114a5699969f7fa1001d54795f76813.webm?t=1746848657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/5114a5699969f7fa1001d54795f76813.mp4?t=1746848657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make the experience even more serene, you'll be surrounded by the gentle sounds of 10 beautiful lo-fi soundtracks, creating the perfect atmosphere for a cozy, laid-back experience. Let the music soothe your soul as you help Bao Bao build her dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/504829c1de7427fe51a6b54a09a9dda4.poster.avif?t=1746848657\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/504829c1de7427fe51a6b54a09a9dda4.webm?t=1746848657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/504829c1de7427fe51a6b54a09a9dda4.mp4?t=1746848657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So come on in, take a deep breath, and feel the warmth of Bao Bao's Cozy Laundromat wrap around you like a favorite blanket. Together, you'll create a place that\u2019s not just about doing laundry\u2014it\u2019s about finding a little bit of peace, happiness, and sweet melodies in the everyday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/7df09bef0a6aa00ea8e10095245e27b9.poster.avif?t=1746848657\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/7df09bef0a6aa00ea8e10095245e27b9.webm?t=1746848657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/7df09bef0a6aa00ea8e10095245e27b9.mp4?t=1746848657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/ad7dfdb380daef77d16b82feff758059.poster.avif?t=1746848657\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/ad7dfdb380daef77d16b82feff758059.webm?t=1746848657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dock mode and window mode\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different washing machines and dryers, and earn money per wash cycle.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of Pandas to help you run the Laundromat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy more land to expand your laundromat.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pandas do need to rest, so help them by placing Benches and feed them by adding Vending Machines to the laundromat\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your laundromat with a variety of plants and other props.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your Twitch audience chat directly through pandas in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your Twitch chat control cats at the laundromat. Because reasons.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes a Focus Timer to assist with study or work sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated discord community.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/d5fb8160225ee67b5a39a390469a510e.poster.avif?t=1746848657\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/d5fb8160225ee67b5a39a390469a510e.webm?t=1746848657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/d5fb8160225ee67b5a39a390469a510e.mp4?t=1746848657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
