b_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/7df09bef0a6aa00ea8e10095245e27b9.poster.avif?t=1746848657\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/7df09bef0a6aa00ea8e10095245e27b9.webm?t=1746848657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/7df09bef0a6aa00ea8e10095245e27b9.mp4?t=1746848657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/ad7dfdb380daef77d16b82feff758059.poster.avif?t=1746848657\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194550/extras/ad7dfdb380daef77d16b82feff758059.webm?t=1746848657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dock mode and window mode\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different washing machines and dryers, and earn money per wash cycle.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of Pandas to help you run the Laundromat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy more land to expand your laundromat.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pandas do need to rest, so help them by placing Benches and feed them by adding Vending Machines to the laundromat\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your laundromat with a variety of plants and other props.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your Twitch audience chat directly through pandas in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your Twitch chat control cats at the laundrom